WEBVTT

00:00:10.106 --> 00:00:13.067
(bell tolling)

00:00:18.615 --> 00:00:20.408
What is that supposed to mean?

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:25.997
- (man) We're under attack!
- (man 2) Sound the alarm!

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.000
- (man 3) Men! Grab your bows!
- (shouting)

00:00:33.421 --> 00:00:36.591
- Peter!
- Our troops are just outside! Come on!

00:00:41.387 --> 00:00:42.722
Now, Ed! Now!

00:00:42.806 --> 00:00:45.266
- Signal the troops!
- I'm a bit busy, Pete!

00:00:57.987 --> 00:00:59.614
Agh!

00:01:01.449 --> 00:01:02.784
Oh...

00:01:07.956 --> 00:01:11.251
Peter! It's too late. We have
to call it off while we can.

00:01:11.334 --> 00:01:13.127
(Peter) No, I can still do this!

00:01:15.004 --> 00:01:16.214
Help me!

00:01:21.678 --> 00:01:26.516
(all straining)

00:01:33.982 --> 00:01:37.277
Exactly who are you
doing this for, Peter?

00:01:42.448 --> 00:01:43.658
Come on!

00:01:52.375 --> 00:01:55.169
Charge!

00:02:00.717 --> 00:02:02.677
(man) We're under attack!

00:02:08.558 --> 00:02:10.852
(man) Attack! Attack!

00:02:19.527 --> 00:02:22.155
- (growling)
- (screaming)

00:02:26.659 --> 00:02:28.786
(all shouting)

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:30.663
For Narnia!

00:02:49.766 --> 00:02:51.059
Ah!

00:03:10.203 --> 00:03:12.413
Archers!

00:03:14.248 --> 00:03:15.708
(man) Pick a target!

00:03:18.211 --> 00:03:19.253
Take aim!

00:03:23.925 --> 00:03:26.469
(screaming)

00:03:27.887 --> 00:03:28.888
Ed!

00:03:45.947 --> 00:03:47.490
(grunts)

00:04:06.217 --> 00:04:08.302
(grunting)

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.224
Ah!

00:04:22.358 --> 00:04:23.693
(groaning)

00:04:31.159 --> 00:04:32.869
Get that gate closed.

00:04:48.259 --> 00:04:50.678
(man grunting behind door)

00:05:19.165 --> 00:05:21.375
(roaring)

00:05:26.547 --> 00:05:27.924
Fall back!

00:05:34.514 --> 00:05:36.224
We need to retreat! Now!

00:05:38.726 --> 00:05:40.895
Go! Get her out of here!

00:05:41.687 --> 00:05:44.273
Back to the gate! Go!

00:05:49.904 --> 00:05:53.449
- Caspian!
- I'll find him!

00:05:53.533 --> 00:05:57.578
Go! Get out! Go!
Get out! Retreat!

00:06:02.542 --> 00:06:04.252
(man) Follow me!

